Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 16:24:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] B5 v2 T4: the selection and fetch scripts, before either
 was run

xval/area-trust/select_v2.py applies readings W7 and W8 with reading 10: the first 14 consecutive
days from 2025-01-20 with every 3-hour Kp at most 4.000 (GFZ file, SHA-256 recorded), the stations
listed at BKG on all 14 days whose every header lists GPS S1C, clustered within 100 km in SHA-256
order of the name, at most 3 clusters. It reads only the header of each observation file and stops
on any failed fetch (W8).

xval/area-trust/fetch_v2.py fetches the selected stations' 14 days and both BKG merged navigation
files per day, keeping the one with more GPS records (B8 reading 8; a tie keeps BRDC00WRD_R), with
every SHA-256 in MANIFEST_v2.tsv and the navigation choice in nav_choice_v2.tsv. It also stops on any
failed fetch.

Neither script had been run when this was committed; no v2 data has been selected or fetched.
